// =============================================================================
// EnhancedV3 Richness V1 — Theme Catalog
// =============================================================================
// Schema version: enhanced-v3-richness-content/v1
//
// Complete 3-theme catalog (alphabetical by ID):
//   ancient < brutalist < egyptian
//
// Every theme defines:
//   - Semantic roles and transition descriptors
//   - Geometry vocabulary tokens available to the theme
//   - Named material roles with texture assignments
//   - Full prop and light compatibility lists
//   - Shared worst-case resource budget ceiling
//
// Theme is presentation data over a theme-independent semantic blueprint.
// For the same seed/richness preset, Ancient, Egyptian, and Brutalist
// preserve room IDs, reserved footprints, topology, critical path, spawn
// safety, route witnesses, pacing beats, and landmarks. Theme may alter
// only reserved interior massing, portal surrounds, materials, props, and
// lights within the shared worst-case complexity reservation.
// =============================================================================

